### Vacation API examples (VS Code "REST Client" extension).
### 1. Run the three login requests first.
### 2. Each login answers with a Set-Cookie header. We keep it in a variable and send it back in the Cookie header.
### 3. Tip: in the REST Client settings, turn off "Remember Cookies For Subsequent Requests",
###    so the cookie of one user is never mixed with the cookie of another.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8888
@contentType = application/json

### Login as requester (Alice)
# @name loginRequester
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "password123" }

###
@requesterCookie = {{loginRequester.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Login as requester (Bob)
# @name loginBob
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "bob@example.com", "password": "password123" }

###
@bobCookie = {{loginBob.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Login as validator (Victor)
# @name loginValidator
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "victor@example.com", "password": "password123" }

###
@validatorCookie = {{loginValidator.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "wrong" }

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}

### No cookie (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### Logout (the answer clears the cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### ---------- Requester ----------

### Submit a request (change the dates to future dates)
POST {{baseUrl}}/requests
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "startDate": "2030-07-01", "endDate": "2030-07-10", "reason": "Summer holiday" }

### Rule: end date cannot be before start date (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/requests
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "startDate": "2030-08-10", "endDate": "2030-08-01" }

### Rule: no requests in the past (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/requests
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "startDate": "2020-01-01", "endDate": "2020-01-05" }

### Rule: no overlap, run after the first request (expect 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/requests
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "startDate": "2030-07-05", "endDate": "2030-07-15" }

### Validation: missing dates (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/requests
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "reason": "No dates" }

### As a requester: list my requests (a requester only ever sees their own, even with userId in the URL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/requests?page=1&limit=10
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}

### As a validator: list all requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/requests?page=1&limit=10
Cookie: {{validatorCookie}}

### My vacation days this year (allowance, used, remaining)
GET {{baseUrl}}/requests/balance
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}

### Rule: not enough vacation days left (expect 400 when the request is longer than the days left)
POST {{baseUrl}}/requests
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "startDate": "2030-01-01", "endDate": "2030-03-31" }

### Cancel my pending request 1 (as Alice. Bob gets 404, a validator gets 403, an approved request gets 409)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/requests/1/cancel
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}

### Team vacations (any role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/team/vacations
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}

### ---------- Validator ----------

### All requests, no filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/requests?page=1&limit=10
Cookie: {{validatorCookie}}

### Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/requests?status=PENDING
Cookie: {{validatorCookie}}

### Filter by user
GET {{baseUrl}}/requests?userId=1
Cookie: {{validatorCookie}}

### List of users for the filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Cookie: {{validatorCookie}}

### Requester cannot list all requests (expect 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/requests
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}

### Approve request 1
PUT {{baseUrl}}/requests/1/approve
Cookie: {{validatorCookie}}

### Rule: approved request cannot be changed (expect 409)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/requests/1/reject
Cookie: {{validatorCookie}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "comment": "Too late" }

### Rule: reject needs a comment (expect 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/requests/2/reject
Cookie: {{validatorCookie}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "comment": "" }

### Reject request 2 with a comment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/requests/2/reject
Cookie: {{validatorCookie}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "comment": "Team is understaffed that week" }

### Rule: only validators can approve (expect 403)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/requests/2/approve
Cookie: {{requesterCookie}}

### Unknown request (expect 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/requests/9999/approve
Cookie: {{validatorCookie}}
